# gitignore file for ekphrasis
# ----------------------------------

## Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp

## Credentials
.git-credentials

## macOS
.DS_Store

## Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

## Build Output (Obsidian plugin bundle)
main.js
*.js.map

## Test Coverage
coverage/

## Tool Caches
.eslintcache

## Example Vault (keep only the shared schemas)
examples/vault/.obsidian/*
!examples/vault/.obsidian/yaml-schemas/

## Claude Code skill-generated backups
.claude/*.bak.*
